<title>SWEDEN: 'When not if' for Sweden's EMU entry - Heikensten.</title>
<headline>'When not if' for Sweden's EMU entry - Heikensten.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's membership of Europe's economic and monetary union is only a question of timing, the deputy governor of the Riksbank, Sweden's central bank, said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The pressure on Sweden to join the planned second phase of Europe's exchange rate mechanism (ERM2) will be strong, deputy governor Lars Heikensten said in a speech.</p>
</text>
